    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Axasyaah, Boqorkii Yahuudah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa dadkii Yeruusaalem degganaa waxay meeshiisii boqor kaga dhigteen Axasyaah oo ahaa wiilkiisii ugu wada yaraa, maxaa yeelay, guutadii ragga ahayd oo reer Carbeed xerada la timid way wada laayeen kuwii waaweynaa oo dhan. Sidaas daraaddeed waxaa boqor noqday Axasyaah ina Yehooraam oo ahaa boqorkii dalka Yahuudah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Axasyaah markuu boqor noqday wuxuu jiray laba iyo afartan sannadood, oo Yeruusaalemna sannad ayuu boqor ku ahaa, oo hooyadiis magaceedana waxaa la odhan jiray Catalyaah ina Coomrii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isaguna wuxuu ku socday jidadkii reerka Axaab maray, waayo, hooyadiis waxay kula talin jirtay inuu shar sameeyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu sameeyey wax Rabbiga hortiisa shar ku ah, sidii reerka Axaab yeeli jiray oo kale, waayo, markii aabbihiis dhintay ka dib iyagaa ahaan jiray lataliyayaashiisii ilaa uu baabba'ay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba wuxuu ku socon jiray taladoodii, wuuna raacay Yehooraam ina Axaab oo ahaa boqorkii dalka Israa'iil inay Xasaa'eel oo ahaa boqorkii Suuriya kula diriraan Raamod Gilecaad, oo reer Suuriyana Yooraam bay dhaawaceen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu ku noqday Yesreceel in lagu soo daweeyo nabrihii ay Raamaah kaga dhufteen markuu la diriray Xasaa'eel oo ahaa boqorkii Suuriya. Markaasaa Axasyaah ina Yehooraam oo ahaa boqorkii dalka Yahuudah tegey inuu soo arko Yehooraam ina Axaab oo joogay Yesreceel, maxaa yeelay, dhaawac buu ahaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba Axasyaah baabbi'iisii wuxuu ka yimid xag Ilaah, markuu Yooraam u tegey, maxaa yeelay, markuu yimid ayuu Yehooraam kula kacay Yeehuu ina Nimshii kaasoo Rabbigu u subkay inuu baabbi'iyo reerka Axaab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kolkii Yeehuu xukunka ku soo dejinayay reerkii Axaab wuxuu helay amiirradii dalka Yahuudah iyo Axasyaah walaalihiis wiilashii ay dhaleen oo Axasyaah u adeegaya, markaasuu iyagii laayay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasuu doondoonay Axasyaah (oo Samaariya ku dhex dhuumanayay), waana la soo qabtay oo waxaa loo keenay Yeehuu, waana la dilay, oo isagii waa la aasay, waayo, waxay isyidhaahdeen, Isaga waxaa dhalay Yehooshaafaad oo Rabbiga ku doondooni jiray qalbigiisa oo dhan. Oo Axasyaah reerkiisiina ma uu lahayn xoog uu boqortooyada ku sii haysto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Catalyaah Iyo Yoo'aash",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba Catalyaah oo ahayd Axasyaah hooyadiis markay aragtay in wiilkeedii dhintay ayay kacday oo wada baabbi'isay farcankii reer boqor ee Yahuudah oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Yehooshabecad oo ahayd boqorka gabadhiisii waxay la tagtay Yoo'aash oo ahaa ina Axasyaah, oo ka dhex xadday wiilashii boqorka ee la laayay isagii iyo tii xannaanayn jirtayba, oo waxay gelisay qolka la seexdo. Haddaba Yehooshabecad oo ahayd Boqor Yehooraam gabadhiis, oo u dhaxday wadaadkii Yehooyaadaac la odhan jiray waxay isagii ka qarisay Catalyaah si ayan isaga u dilin (maxaa yeelay, iyadu waxay ahayd Axasyaah walaashiis). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo intii lix sannadood ah ayuu kula qarsoonaa guriga Ilaah, oo dalkiina waxaa u talisay Catalyaah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
